# Make App UX Guideline Priority

When working on any UX-related changes for Make apps (labels, help/hint text, field structure, messages, module naming, field ordering, etc.), **always read the UX best practices reference first** before making changes:

```
~/.cursor/skills/make-custom-app/references/app-ux-best-practices.md
```

Never rely on memory or assumptions for UX conventions. The reference is the source of truth.
